  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-099-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:brother" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">將軍<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-099-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:brother:m0002" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">桓沖</persName>又敗秦丞相<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-099-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:brother:m0009" ref="o0k_xjc_d5b">雄</persName>於白鹿原。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-099-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:brother:m0015" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-099-jin098-huanwen-guanzhong:brother:m0017" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>之弟也。</p>
